,{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/11/1994451/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンゴーかき氷を食べるのを\n楽しみにしている時の私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんと半分こしました！\n一個全部は食べれない！\nかき氷好きな流石の私でも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではなくて！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見にくいけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がヘビロテしてるのは\n茶色のシフォントップス( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋色！！茶色！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lily Brownだよ◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りブランド◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏に買ったんだけど、\n色的に少し早いかな〜と思ってたから\nあんまり着てなかったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも素材的には涼しいし\n前のレースの部分は透けるから涼し気！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから丁度今の時期にぴったりなんだ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして耳元にはべっ甲柄のフープイヤリング。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べっ甲、今私が一番気になる柄！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋っぽいし、レトロで可愛く見える〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べっ甲はアクセサリーや靴に取り入れたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋色のお洋服、女の子はもちろん\n男性の皆さんもファッションに是非取り入れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだけ秋を先取りしましょう\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「鬼」クリープハイプさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癖になる〜\nこの声とテンポに！\n歌詞が繰り返されてるから\n耳にも残る〜○\n妹もクリープハイプさん好きだから\nお家にCDもあるし、\nアルバムの世界観もある！！\nこれからじっくり聞いてきます( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/11/1994451/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまにちゅーされそうで\n喜ぶ私のにやけ顔！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、ちまに会ったら\nすぐぎゅーしにいく(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶらぶなの(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}